| **~00:04–00:11** | Krandal **actually buys an 8-gp beast of burden named Sean** (GM describes a reddish-brown ~420-pound **donkey**, player alternately says mule; precise species needs audio/source check). Snake guard **Noparopa** attaches the **Goodwine-gift Kingdom Light plow** to himself before animal arrives; Krandal assigns farm tasks. Koh considers sale and downsizing but **has not yet purchased** at this point. After five days Carrie **writes** that she wants to investigate why recovered wife **Anathala** was Khalazar's early target; **Anathala herself agrees to testing**, Koh retains psychic contact for safety. |
